{"version": 2, "width": 96, "height": 28, "timestamp": 1794164557, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": null}, "title": "Ultron operating-layer preview"}
[0.040604, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;51m╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n║  ULTRON  /  PERSONAL OPERATING LAYER                                 ║\r\n╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[38;5;245mA native-OS assistant shell. The underlying OS stays in control.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.740863, "o", "\u001b[38;5;39mCAPABILITIES\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;48m▸\u001b[0m Computer use     Window, keyboard and screen actions behind consent gates\r\n  \u001b[38;5;48m▸\u001b[0m Web search       Search current sources; return citations and snippets\r\n  \u001b[38;5;48m▸\u001b[0m Web reading      Public pages only; robots.txt checked; no block bypass\r\n  \u001b[38;5;48m▸\u001b[0m Health center    Persistent notices, ignore/dismiss, tested repair proposals\r\n  \u001b[38;5;48m▸\u001b[0m Visual themes    Classic Cyan, Holographic, Violet Nebula, Amber Arc\r\n\r\n"]
[1.741153, "o", "\u001b[38;5;39mHEALTH CENTER  \u001b[38;5;245m— synthetic offline fixture\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.743901, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;221m!\u001b[0m Health notice i7ef6169c57: Example microphone is unavailable.\r\n  Actions: ignore i7ef6169c57  ·  dismiss i7ef6169c57  ·  fix i7ef6169c57\r\n  \u001b[38;5;245mThe notice is stored locally; no hardware was queried.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.744677, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;48m✓\u001b[0m Issue i7ef6169c57 ignored. No code changed.\r\n\r\n"]
[3.545334, "o", "\u001b[38;5;39mREPAIR POLICY\u001b[0m\r\n  Candidate patch → background full-harness rehearsal → owner reviews the diff\r\n  Two separate confirmations → explicit apply. A test pass never auto-deploys.\r\n\r\n"]
[4.34549, "o", "\u001b[38;5;245mScripted README preview · offline · synthetic health event · no OS or web actions\u001b[0m\r\n"]
